  "access": {
    "level": "public",
    "note": "Hike of about one mile from a parking lot on Blue Mountain Road, with a 944-foot climb. The 2018 register visit report says the Azure Mountain Friends maintain the trail and tower. No source sets out current rules for the cab, and none confirms that visitors can climb it now. A July 2007 register visit report says the tower was open to the public at that time; that is too old to treat as current."
  },
